                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "What is Afterpay?",
                    "name": "shipping-and-returns",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_4C6JdR": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Afterpay is a great way to shop now and pay later. You can choose Afterpay in the checkout process and simply enter your credit card information. Your payment will be split into 4 equal payments which will charge every 2 weeks with zero interest and no fees when you pay on time.</p>",
