                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Do Algenist products contain fragrances?",
                    "name": "",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_Wain74": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>We use a variety of fragrances to enhance the sensory experience of our Algenist collections, all at very low levels. Every product is thoroughly tested to ensure safety for consumer use. Based on customer feedback, our line includes both fragranced and fragrance-free options. For those with sensitivities or a preference to avoid fragrance, we recommend choosing our <a href=\"/collections/sensitive\" title=\"Sensitive & Fragrance-Free\">fragrance free products. </a><br/><br/></p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
