              "blocks": {
                "accordion_row_HN9chR": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Unauthorized Resellers",
                    "name": "",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_UeMLhV": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Authenticity, expiry or quality can only be guaranteed when purchased directly from Algenist.com or any of our authorized North American resellers: Amazon, BEAUTYSPACE, Bloomingdale’s, Dillard’s, Nordstrom, Ulta Beauty, and QVC. Algenist stands behind our products unconditionally when they are purchased from an authorized reseller. However, our warranty does not apply to products purchased from unauthorized resellers.<br/><br/></p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
